From 77aadb8feaf3c068af6751a704df252c941e2604 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 06:51:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Ignore databases wherever a misconfigured path puts them

Prisma resolves a relative DATABASE_URL from prisma/schema.prisma rather than
the project root, so file:./db/custom.db creates prisma/db/custom.db and
leaves the intended database untouched. A second database was committed that
way. The ignore rule now covers any .db file rather than one directory, and
db/README.md records why the path is easy to get wrong.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HTApKorFpaLx1vvsjzuQEc
---
 .gitignore          |   7 +++++--
 db/README.md        |  15 +++++++++++++++
 prisma/db/custom.db | Bin 364544 -> 0 bytes
 3 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 prisma/db/custom.db

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index c73fedd..9fafed5 100755
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -63,5 +63,8 @@ server.log
 public/slide-runtime.css
 
 # local development database — never version this, it overwrites other machines
-db/*.db
-db/*.db-journal
+# Prisma resolves a relative DATABASE_URL from prisma/schema.prisma, so a
+# misconfigured path creates prisma/db/ instead of db/. Ignore both.
+**/*.db
+**/*.db-journal
+**/*.db-wal
diff --git a/db/README.md b/db/README.md
index d0eae7b..35c1ca8 100644
--- a/db/README.md
+++ b/db/README.md
@@ -10,3 +10,18 @@ To create it from scratch:
 npx prisma db push   # schema
 npm run db:seed      # optional demo content
 ```
+
+## The path matters
+
+Prisma resolves a relative `DATABASE_URL` from `prisma/schema.prisma`, not from
+the project root. `file:./db/custom.db` therefore creates `prisma/db/custom.db`
+and leaves the real database untouched.
+
+Use:
+
+```
+DATABASE_URL=file:../db/custom.db
+```
+
+If you already have a `prisma/db/custom.db`, that is where your data went. Move
+it to `db/custom.db` and fix the path, or point `DATABASE_URL` at it directly.
diff --git a/prisma/db/custom.db b/prisma/db/custom.db
deleted file mode 100644
